{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  PRODUCT RECOMMENDATIONS SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic product recommendation display using Shopify's recommendation engine
  - Integrates with Shopify's AI-powered product recommendation system
  - Swiper.js-powered carousel for smooth product browsing
  - Responsive grid layout with customizable products per row
  - Conditional rendering based on recommendation availability
  - Uses product-block snippet for consistent product display
  - Supports vendor display and color swatch hiding options
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CONDITIONAL SECTION RENDERING
  =============================================================================
  Only displays section when recommendations are enabled
  - section.settings.show_product_recommendations: Toggle from theme editor
  - Prevents unnecessary rendering when recommendations are disabled
  - Allows merchants to control section visibility
{% endcomment %}
{% if section.settings.show_product_recommendations %}
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MAIN RECOMMENDATIONS CONTAINER
    =============================================================================
    Primary container with data attributes for functionality
    - product-recommendations: Base styling class for section
    - data-section-type: Identifies section type for JavaScript
    - data-components: Required JavaScript component initialization
    - data-url: Shopify recommendations API endpoint with parameters
    - section_id: Current section identifier for API requests
    - product_id: Current product ID for personalized recommendations
    - limit: Maximum number of recommended products (12)
  {% endcomment %}
  <div class="product-recommendations"
       data-section-type="product-recommendations"
       data-components="product-block"
       data-url="{{ routes.product_recommendations_url }}?section_id={{ section.id }}&product_id={{ product.id }}&limit=12">

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      RECOMMENDATIONS VALIDATION & DISPLAY
      =============================================================================
      Checks if recommendations are available and have products
      - recommendations.performed: Boolean indicating API call completion
      - recommendations.products_count: Number of available recommendations
      - Only displays content when recommendations are successfully loaded
      - Prevents empty section display when no recommendations exist
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if recommendations.performed and recommendations.products_count > 0 %}
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        RECOMMENDATIONS CONTENT WRAPPER
        =============================================================================
        Content container with responsive layout and spacing
        - product-recommendations-container: Main content wrapper
        - product-slider: Slider-specific styling class
        - wide-container: Responsive width container
        - section-spacing: Consistent vertical spacing between sections
      {% endcomment %}
      <div class="product-recommendations-container product-slider">
        <div class="wide-container section-spacing">
          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            PRODUCT LIST WITH SWIPER INTEGRATION
            =============================================================================
            Swiper.js container for carousel functionality
            - product-list: Base styling class for product grid
            - swiper-container: Required class for Swiper.js initialization
            - data-products-in-view: Custom attribute for grid configuration
            - section.settings.grid: Products per row setting (2-4)
            - Enables responsive carousel behavior
          {% endcomment %}
          <div class="product-list swiper-container" data-products-in-view="{{ section.settings.grid }}">
            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              SECTION HEADING
              =============================================================================
              Configurable section title with animation
              - h2: Semantic heading level for accessibility
              - section-heading: Consistent heading styling
              - section.settings.title: Custom title from theme editor
              - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger
              - Default text: "You may also like"
            {% endcomment %}
            <h2 class="h2 section-heading" data-cc-animate>
              {{ section.settings.title }}
            </h2>

            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              SWIPER WRAPPER FOR PRODUCT SLIDES
              =============================================================================
              Swiper.js wrapper for individual product slides
              - swiper-wrapper: Required class for Swiper.js functionality
              - data-normheights: Normalizes heights for consistent layout
              - data-normheights-inner: Inner element for height normalization
              - .image: CSS selector for image container height normalization
              - img: CSS selector for image height normalization
              - Ensures uniform slide heights for better visual consistency
            {% endcomment %}
            <div class="swiper-wrapper" data-normheights=".image" data-normheights-inner="img">
              {% comment %}
                =============================================================================
                PRODUCT RECOMMENDATIONS LOOP
                =============================================================================
                Iterates through Shopify's recommended products
                - recommendations.products: Array of recommended product objects
                - forloop.index: Current iteration index for animation
                - Creates individual product slides for each recommendation
                - Integrates with product-block snippet for consistent display
              {% endcomment %}
              {%- for product in recommendations.products -%}
                {% comment %}
                  =============================================================================
                  INDIVIDUAL PRODUCT SLIDE
                  =============================================================================
                  Single product slide with Swiper.js integration
                  - swiper-slide: Required class for Swiper.js slide functionality
                  - product-block: Renders individual product using snippet
                  - product: Current product object from recommendations
                  - product_class: CSS class for product styling
                  - i: forloop.index for unique product identification
                  - animate: Animation trigger based on loop index
                  - show_vendor: Toggle for vendor display
                  - hide_swatches: Toggle for color swatch visibility
                {% endcomment %}
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  {% render 'product-block', product: product, product_class: product_class, i: forloop.index, animate: forloop.index, show_vendor: section.settings.show_vendor, hide_swatches: section.settings.hide_swatches %}
                </div>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            
            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              SWIPER NAVIGATION CONTROLS
              =============================================================================
              Carousel navigation elements for user interaction
              - swiper-scrollbar: Progress bar showing current position
              - swiper-button-prev: Previous button with accessibility label
              - swiper-button-next: Next button with accessibility label
              - aria-label: Screen reader accessible navigation labels
              - general.accessibility_labels.previous/next: Localized labels
              - svg-chevron-left/right: Directional arrow icons
            {% endcomment %}
            <div class="swiper-scrollbar"></div>
            <a href="#" class="swiper-button-prev" aria-label="{{ 'general.accessibility_labels.previous' | t | escape }}">{% render 'svg-chevron-left' %}</a>
            <a href="#" class="swiper-button-next" aria-label="{{ 'general.accessibility_labels.next' | t | escape }}">{% render 'svg-chevron-right' %}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for the product recommendations section
  
  **SECTION OVERVIEW:**
  Dynamic product recommendation display using Shopify's AI-powered recommendation engine.
  Integrates with Swiper.js for smooth carousel functionality and responsive design.
  
  **KEY FEATURES:**
  - Shopify's AI-powered product recommendations
  - Swiper.js carousel with navigation controls
  - Responsive grid layout (2-4 products per row)
  - Conditional rendering based on recommendation availability
  - Consistent product display using product-block snippet
  
  **SECTION SETTINGS:**
  - show_product_recommendations: Toggle section visibility (default: true)
  - title: Custom section heading (default: "You may also like")
  - hide_swatches: Toggle color swatch visibility (default: false)
  - show_vendor: Toggle vendor display (default: false)
  - grid: Products per row (2-4, default: 3)
  
  **RECOMMENDATION SYSTEM:**
  - Uses Shopify's recommendation API endpoint
  - Personalized based on current product
  - Maximum 12 recommended products
  - Dynamic content that improves over time
  - Automatic fallback when no recommendations available
  
  **CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY:**
  - Swiper.js integration for smooth scrolling
  - Previous/next navigation buttons
  - Progress scrollbar for position indication
  - Height normalization for consistent layout
  - Touch-friendly mobile interactions
  
  **ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES:**
  - Semantic HTML structure with proper headings
  - ARIA labels for navigation controls
  - Screen reader friendly content structure
  - Keyboard accessible carousel controls
  
  **PERFORMANCE CONSIDERATIONS:**
  - Conditional rendering prevents unnecessary DOM
  - Lazy loading through Swiper.js
  - Efficient product-block snippet rendering
  - Optimized image handling through product-block
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product recommendations",
  "class": "section-product-recommendations",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_product_recommendations",
      "label": "Show recommendations",
      "info": "Dynamic recommendations change and improve with time. [Learn more](https://help.shopify.com/en/themes/development/recommended-products)",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "You may also like"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hide_swatches",
      "label": "Hide color swatches",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_vendor",
      "label": "Show product vendor",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "grid",
      "label": "Products per row",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 3
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
